   Toolchains

   A toolchain installs tools. When several are usable, choose one.

   ✅ bash 5.2 runs kit
 ▸ ❌ jq is not installed   ⧉   ▶️ 
      brew install jq
   ❌ several toolchains are usable for the project: mise, brew; choose one
      kit toolchains use mise
      or: kit toolchains use brew
   ❌ brew is installed but not on PATH
      eval "$(/opt/homebrew/bin/brew shellenv)"
      add it to your shell profile to keep it












